# Border style and Separator style (reference/common/box.md#border-style). Page area of 260 × 360 from (20, 20).
# The style of a line only changes how it is painted: every box measures what it would with a solid border.
#
# b1 to b6 (style b: Margin bottom 10): dashed with square corners; dotted with a color per side; dashed and dotted
#   following a Corner radius, the dotted one in a translucent color; a dashed line to cut along (only the top side)
#   and a dotted line to sign on (only the bottom side).
# t: Merge borders, from a rule. Columns of 100 at x = 20 and 120. The cells have Padding: 2 and a dashed Border: 1 in
#   #333333 and hold a block 10 high; the header cells (style head), a solid border in #C00000 with a bottom side of 2,
#   which wins against the top side of the body: the line between the two rows is solid.
#   Rows: header 1 + 14 + 1 = 16; body 1 + 14 + 1 = 16.
# c: a Columns with a dotted Separator of 2, centered in its Gap of 20.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 400
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For style: b
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 10 0
		For element: Cell
			Box:
				Padding: 2
				Border: 1
				Border color: #333333
				Border style: dashed
		For element: Table
			Box:
				Merge borders: true
				Margin: 0 0 10 0
		For style: head
			Box:
				Border: 1 1 2 1
				Border color: #C00000
				Border style: solid
		For style: fill
			Box:
				Height: 10
				Background: #B5D4F4
	Section:
		Block:
			Id: b1
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 30
				Border: 2
				Border style: dashed
		Block:
			Id: b2
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 30
				Border: 2
				Border color: #C00000 #1F6FB2 #2E7D32 #B5651D
				Border style: dotted
				Background: #F2F2F2
		Block:
			Id: b3
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 40
				Border: 2
				Border style: dashed
				Corner radius: 10
				Background: #F2F2F2
		Block:
			Id: b4
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 40
				Border: 3
				Border color: #1F6FB280
				Border style: dotted
				Corner radius: 12
		Block:
			Id: b5
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 10
				Border: 1 0 0 0
				Border style: dashed
		Block:
			Id: b6
			Style: b
			Box:
				Height: 10
				Border: 0 0 0.5 0
				Border style: dotted
		Table:
			Id: t
			Column sizes: 100 100
			Header rows:
				Row:
					Style: head
					Cell:
						Block:
							Style: fill
					Cell:
						Block:
							Style: fill
			Body rows:
				Row:
					Cell:
						Block:
							Style: fill
					Cell:
						Block:
							Style: fill
		Columns:
			Id: c
			Column count: 2
			Gap: 20
			Separator: 2
			Separator color: #C00000
			Separator style: dotted
			Block:
				Box:
					Height: 30
					Background: #B5D4F4
			Block:
				Box:
					Height: 30
					Background: #B5D4F4
